---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Terms | MathMyRate" description="Terms of use for MathMyRate: results are estimates, fee rules cover named scenarios only, and nothing here is tax, legal, or financial advice.">
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
    <h1 class="display mt-4 text-5xl font-bold leading-none md:text-6xl">Fair use, plainly stated.</h1>
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">
      <div>
        <h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Estimates, not advice</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Every result is an estimate generated from the inputs you supply and the documented assumptions shown on each page. Nothing here is tax, accounting, legal, or financial advice. You are responsible for the amounts you quote, charge, or file.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Fee rules are scenario-specific</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Provider fee rules apply only to the account market, currency, product, and channel their official source documents, and providers can change their pricing at any time. A result produced for an unsupported scenario, or after a provider's price change without a reviewed update, may be wrong. Each fee page names its supported scenario and review date.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">No warranty</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">This site is provided as is, without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement. Availability, correctness, and completeness are not guaranteed.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">To the maximum extent permitted by law, the site's operator is not liable for any damages arising from the use of, or inability to use, this site or its results, including underquotes, overquotes, mispriced fees, and tax positions.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Permitted use</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">You may use the calculators for planning your own work and sales. You may not misrepresent this site as affiliated with any payment provider, or present its estimates as professional advice given to third parties.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
